  "description": "Conversion of Juliet balcony to roof terrace with privacy screening and balustrades.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed roof terrace, by reason of its elevated position, size, and siting, would introduce an unneighbourly form of development that results in direct, intrusive overlooking into the private amenity spaces and habitable room windows of adjoining residential properties. This would cause an undue loss of privacy and significant harm to the residential amenity of neighbouring occupiers, contrary to policy LP2 (Development and Amenity) of the Hackney Local Plan 2033.&lt;/p&gt;"
